    "name": "Sudoku 9x16x25",
    "steam_appid": 1089880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/e881c76d3eac488ad9d5ff6ade03634a.poster.avif?t=1734424211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/e881c76d3eac488ad9d5ff6ade03634a.webm?t=1734424211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/e881c76d3eac488ad9d5ff6ade03634a.mp4?t=1734424211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We invite you to plunge into the world of puzzles, prepared for you - Sudoku 9X16X25. The rules are simple - fill in the grid by digits in such a way that they do not repeat horizontally, vertically and in the nearest square.\u00a0Also, you can complicate or simplify the game by changing the numbers to letters or symbols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game have different sizes, difficulty levels and a huge number of puzzles, especially for those who are not afraid of difficult tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under quiet music and pleasant game design, you can brighten up your leisure time and develop your logic skills.   <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/10dc27da17af2a51d33626f5885688f7.poster.avif?t=1734424211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/10dc27da17af2a51d33626f5885688f7.webm?t=1734424211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/10dc27da17af2a51d33626f5885688f7.mp4?t=1734424211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The size of the playing field: 9\u04459; 16\u044516; 25\u044525</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to change numbers to letters or symbols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150 puzzles for each size (9\u04459; 16\u044516; 25\u044525)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">User mode.\u00a0Random level generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">User-friendly design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make notes opportunity</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saving level progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are settings: music volume and screen resolution</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/e881c76d3eac488ad9d5ff6ade03634a.poster.avif?t=1734424211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/e881c76d3eac488ad9d5ff6ade03634a.webm?t=1734424211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/e881c76d3eac488ad9d5ff6ade03634a.mp4?t=1734424211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We invite you to plunge into the world of puzzles, prepared for you - Sudoku 9X16X25. The rules are simple - fill in the grid by digits in such a way that they do not repeat horizontally, vertically and in the nearest square.\u00a0Also, you can complicate or simplify the game by changing the numbers to letters or symbols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game have different sizes, difficulty levels and a huge number of puzzles, especially for those who are not afraid of difficult tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under quiet music and pleasant game design, you can brighten up your leisure time and develop your logic skills.   <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/10dc27da17af2a51d33626f5885688f7.poster.avif?t=1734424211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/10dc27da17af2a51d33626f5885688f7.webm?t=1734424211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1089880/extras/10dc27da17af2a51d33626f5885688f7.mp4?t=1734424211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The size of the playing field: 9\u04459; 16\u044516; 25\u044525</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to change numbers to letters or symbols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150 puzzles for each size (9\u04459; 16\u044516; 25\u044525)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">User mode.\u00a0Random level generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">User-friendly design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make notes opportunity</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saving level progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are settings: music volume and screen resolution</p></li></ul>",
